[03/17 22:53:51     37s]     #-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
[03/17 22:53:51     37s]     # The FLOWTOOL_NUM_CPUS is an environment variable which should be exported by
[03/17 22:53:51     37s]     # the specified dist script.  This connects the number of CPUs being reserved
[03/17 22:53:51     37s]     # for batch jobs with the current flow scripts.  The LSB_MAX_NUM_PROCESSORS is
[03/17 22:53:51     37s]     # a typical environment variable exported by distribution platforms and is
